{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう、あなたを待っていました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は読んでいる側“は”カロリー低めだからどうか最後まで見ていってほしい、という気持ち。((※))"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お願いー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(※)矢田萌華的な“カロリー高めのブログ”とは、それ即ち自分の写真が多く写っているブログということです。\n写真も文章もどんどーーん！なんて器用なことは私には出来ないので、大体いつも文章と写真のどちらかに重みが偏ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つまり今回は、写真多めというわけです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けどほかのメンバーとの写真多め！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【萌え萌え写真館】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "萌え萌えという名前だからといって必ずしも“萌え”な写真という訳ではありません。\nご承知おきください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木恋にて、矢田萌華。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobIC5TiQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってる。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生で初めてこんなに高いツインテールをしてみたはいいものの鏡を見る度にちょっと心が疲れた矢田萌華。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみにこれは、あやてぃーさんとのとある小さな約束を果たすためでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(この日はあやてぃーさんと同じレーンのミーグリだった)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobHx43le.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "続いてこちら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "相撲が強いでお馴染みのせとぐっちーさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "→詳しくはこちらを。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/6irh5cjTy2I?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mob4hOW4O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなみーさんをホールドしている矢田萌華"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは、実質の相撲クイーンは私、、、と言っても過言ではないですね……。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(((過言でしかない)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "研修時代の矢田萌華"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobcxjEND.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだメイクの「メ」の字も知らなかった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今、絶賛メイクについて勉強中！！\nお姉さま方どうか私に知識をください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも何故か顎を掴んでくる大好きな子"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobibWXOQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⊂(  ᴖ ̫ᴖ)⊃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "# 今日の夜ご飯なにかな〜\n# が口癖の学生時代。\n#もえろぐ"}], "source": "official"}